 2. 📈 Data center construction boom 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: Census Bureau, FactSet. Chart: Matt Phillips/Axios 🚧 Construction spending on AI data center "shells" soared in July, rising at an annualized rate of nearly 60% from July 2025 levels, Axios' Matt Phillips writes .

 Why it matters: It shows the AI-building frenzy was gathering strength this summer. 📊 By the numbers: Data center construction spending jumped to an annual pace of more than $75 billion in July, according to Census Bureau data out today.

 That figure represents the value of the construction "put in place" during the month. Share this story ... How data centers work . 

 
 
