 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Texas highway sign on Interstate 610 in Houston today. Photo: Elizabeth Conley/Houston Chronicle via Getty Images 🌀 The National Hurricane Center warns that Tropical Storm Edouard could become a hurricane by tomorrow as it is expected to make landfall in Texas and Louisiana. Get the latest . 🚓 A Bank of America vice president was killed yesterday in a deadly stabbing in Times Square that left one person injured and the suspect dead, Bloomberg reports. 📬 A whistleblower is alleging that the U.S. Postal Service defied court orders while rushing to build a new ballot system that could reject thousands of mail ballots, Axios' Andrew Pantazi and Donica Phifer report . 🏛️ Jurors in the Lindsay Clancy trial in Massachusetts told the judge they couldn't reach a verdict after 18 hours, but the judge instructed them to keep deliberating. Get the latest . 🍿 Netflix has a documentary coming about Trump's catering-truck escape from Air Force One, " Instadocs: The Decoy Plane ," premiering Friday. Watch the trailer . 
 
