 4. 📍1 for the road: MapQuest takeover 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Photo: Mert Alper Dervis/Anadolu via Getty Images 📱 MapQuest (remember them?) skyrocketed to the top of Apple's app store after defying President Trump's call to rename Lake Ontario as "Lake America."

 The app surpassed Google Maps and Apple Maps in the app store, TechCrunch reports . Read MapQuest's release . 

 
 
